OL,6,     FTeleshopping with High Street TV
OL,7,G0855 Four in a Bed
OL,8,     FThe week begins at the Old Rose &
OL,9,     FCrown in Birmingham, where
OL,10,     Fpaintwork problems and missing
OL,11,     Fmilk leave hosts Andrew and Jo
OL,12,     Fwith some meaty feedback to chew
OL,13,     Fover.
OL,14,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,15,     FJill and Inez host the second
OL,16,     Fvisit at Middlewick in
OL,17,     FGlastonbury, where their guests
OL,18,     Fare confounded by a cottage next
OL,19,     Fto a camping pod, and by the
OL,20,     Favocado breakfast offering.
