OL,5,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's feedback time as the B&Bers
OL,7,     Fdiscuss paying for breakfast and
OL,8,     Fpicky comments about paintwork.
OL,9,     FHarsh truths are aired before the
OL,10,     Fpayments are revealed and the
OL,11,     Fwinner is announced.
OL,12,G1135 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FEast Cheshire. Glamorous pensioner
OL,14,     FVal hosts a fun and flirty night
OL,15,     Ffeaturing a Middle Eastern banquet
OL,16,     Fand belly dancing. But spicy food
OL,17,     Fmakes guest Michelle's ears itch!
OL,18,     F(Ep1/5)
