OL,12,G1340 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FEast Cheshire. The final host,
OL,14,     Fparty-loving Zoe, has high hopes
OL,15,     Ffor her international menu and
OL,16,     Fflamboyant entertainment,
OL,17,     Ffeaturing funky hats, disco lights
OL,18,     Fand vodka shots. (Ep5/5)
